  <summary>Personal budget manager with encrypted database</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="pt-BR">Gerenciador de orçamento pessoal com banco cifrado</summary>

  <description>
    <p>PeuBud is a personal budget application built in C++20/Qt6 with focus on
    Brazilian fiscal rules. Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Income, expenses, investments and credit card tracking</li>
      <li>Encrypted SQLite database (XChaCha20-Poly1305 + Argon2id)</li>
      <li>Built-in financial calculators (TVM, CET, Price/SAC, FIRE)</li>
      <li>Brazilian fiscal calculators (INSS, IRPF, Simples Nacional)</li>
      <li>Automatic backup with retention policy</li>
      <li>Monthly closing with immutable snapshots</li>
      <li>Receipt attachments for IRPF declaration</li>
      <li>Audit trail via SQLite triggers</li>
      <li>Import OFX/CSV/XLSX with duplicate detection</li>
    </ul>
    <p xml:lang="pt-BR">PeuBud é um aplicativo de orçamento pessoal em C++20/Qt6
    com foco em regras fiscais brasileiras.</p>
  </description>

